    "result_text": "Both `@core` tests pass. The change is implemented as a full-stack, additive slice:\n\n**Database** \u2014 `V4__invoices.sql`: new `invoices` table (`id`, `project_id` FK \u2192 `projects`, `amount NUMERIC(19,2)`).\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor) \u2014 three new logic classes + records and one repository, each wired by its own YAML file, no edits to central wiring:\n- `GET /api/invoices?projectId=<id>` (`InvoicesGetLogic`) \u2014 a project's invoices, ordered by id.\n- `POST /api/invoices` (`InvoicesPostLogic`) \u2014 adds an invoice (validates a positive project id and non\u2011negative amount).\n- `Invoice`, `NewInvoice`, `InvoiceRepository` for the data layer.\n\n**Test support** \u2014 `TestSupportController` now truncates `invoices` on reset and seeds them from the fixture using the explicit ids, matching the spec's `invoices` array shape.\n\n**Front-end** \u2014 kept inside the projects feature (invoices are shown in the project context):\n- Each project row gets a stable `project-open-<id>` button.\n- New `ProjectInvoices.tsx` renders `project-invoices-table` with `invoice-row-<id>`/`invoice-amount` (2\u2011decimal), a derived `project-invoices-total`, and an add form (`invoice-form-amount` / `invoice-form-submit`) that appends the created invoice and updates the total.\n\nNo pinned scaffolding (`bin/*`, `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, the spec) was touched.",
